  "checks": [
    "WAM: hermes-agent (oscarhenrycollins/hermes-agent) is the proposed own-tab exception: no binding, grant or listener credential",
    "WAM: the dashboard opens at its own https origin",
    "WAM: browser grants are refused for the own-tab dashboard",
    "Agent Service: /wizard/v1/apps flags the dashboard own_tab at its own https address",
    "shell: the Hermes Agent tile carries ownTab and its own https address",
    "opening Hermes Agent from the app picker opens a NEW TAB at the dashboard's own origin",
    "no Wizard window frames the dashboard (no iframe of its origin anywhere in the shell)",
    "the tab's navigation reached the dashboard as a same-site top-level document and its reply says X-Frame-Options DENY",
    "the tab has no opener and no referrer (nothing crosses from the shell)",
    "the dashboard asks for its own login (no Wizard credential crosses into it)",
    "the dashboard's own session cookie is set on its own origin after its own login",
    "own-origin API call with the dashboard session works through the gated front (GET /api/auth/me 200)",
    "own-page WebSocket upgrade passes the front and is decided by Hermes itself (status 101, browser open=true)",
    "the hostile app runs in the opaque sandboxed frame",
    "hostile frame: its credentialed CORS read of /api/auth/me fails in the browser",
    "server-side: all 5 requests from the opaque frame to the dashboard's origin (empty, image, websocket, iframe) were refused 403 by the front",
    "the nested <iframe> of the dashboard was refused (Sec-Fetch-Dest iframe → 403, X-Frame-Options DENY)",
    "the frame's WebSocket upgrade (Origin null) was refused 403 before Hermes",
    "same-origin app tab → the dashboard's origin: all 3 same-site requests (fetch, no-cors logout POST, iframe) refused 403 server-side",
    "those refused requests carried the dashboard's session cookie (SameSite=Lax sends it same-site); the front refused them anyway",
    "the owner's dashboard session survived the hostile same-site logout POST (still 200)",
    "the dashboard's own page: X-Frame-Options DENY, frame-ancestors 'none', COOP same-origin",
    "a box caller (e.g. the ChatGPT/Claude apps using the dashboard API in fresh mode) is not refused by the front (200)"
  ],
